egration feeds configured on one form (provider, name, enabled state) — the notifications and third-party connections that fire when the form is submitted. Requires form_id.','List Integrations'=>'List Integrations','Form "%1$s" has %2$d fields.'=>'Form "%1$s" has %2$d fields.','%d form found.'=>'%d form found.' . "\0" . '%d forms found.','Form "%1$s" created (#%2$d).'=>'Form "%1$s" created (#%2$d).','Message'=>'Message','title is required.'=>'title is required.','Full detail for one form: status, type, timestamps, and the field schema (each input key, label, and element type) so you know the exact keys that appear in submission responses.'=>'Full detail for one form: status, type, timestamps, and the field schema (each input key, label, and element type) so you know the exact keys that appear in submission responses.','Get Form'=>'Get Form','Find and filter forms with compact rows (id, title, status, type, entry count). Use this to discover the form_id you need for list-submissions and get-form-stats.'=>'Find and filter forms with compact rows (id, title, status, type, entry count). Use this to discover the form_id you need for list-submissions and get-form-stats.','List Forms'=>'List Forms','Fields for "%s" updated.'=>'Fields for "%s" updated.','The form became multi-step while this update was in flight; edit it in the form builder.'=>'The form became multi-step while this update was in flight; edit it in the form builder.','The form changed while this update was in flight. Run a fresh dry_run to re-preview which fields would be removed, then execute.'=>'The form changed while this update was in flight. Run a fresh dry_run to re-preview which fields would be removed, then execute.','The form was deleted while this update was in flight.'=>'The form was deleted while this update was in flight.','No stored field keys are removed.'=>'No stored field keys are removed.','Entries stored under the removed field keys will no longer display against those fields. To execute,